{
  "description": "std-proof — a marketing section that shows evidence: who uses it, what was made with it, who backs it. `proofLook` picks how: testimonials (portrait, quote, name and role in cards), portfolio (image-led case-study cards that link to the work), logos (a static row of client, sponsor, partner or technology logos), marquee (the same logos or wordmarks with icons gliding past in a continuous strip that pauses on hover and stands still for reduced motion) or badges (name chips, for technologies or certifications without logo images). One `entries` list feeds every look; the heading says what the items are. Carries the same band knobs as the other site sections. Pick for landing, product and campaign pages.",
